{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "281f5766-d78c-8e5e-bc24-1598d945be78",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T11:43:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jose Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:41:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:41:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Um, my trash didn't get picked up again. Well, the recycling too. I'm trying to find out what the new schedule is after the holiday week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:41:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. What's the address where it was missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:41:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "52 Marsh Street, down in The Point. I'm the landlord, I've got tenants there and they keep texting me about the barrels."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-two Marsh Street. Got it. And you said this is a repeat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:42:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's the second miss in a row. Last week nothing came, and then this morning, nothing. The bins are just sitting there full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:42:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. Right after Christmas and New Year's the routes get pushed back a day, and sometimes it takes a couple of weeks to settle. Let me pull up your street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, and by the way, I always thought this office was on the other side of town. Like I figured I'd have to drive over. Anyway, so what's the day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:42:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're the Public Works line, so you can just call, no driving needed. For Marsh Street, I'm showing the regular pickup as Monday, but the holiday weeks shifted it. So this week it should be back to normal, Monday, and I'm going to repeat that. Monday, with the barrels out by the curb early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:42:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "But it's already Monday and it's almost noon. They didn't come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:42:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Then I'll put in a missed pickup report for fifty-two Marsh Street, trash and recycling both. Sometimes the truck hits that side late in the day, so if you can leave them out until this evening, that's the safest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Yeah, I'll tell the tenants to leave them out. Oh, and can you tell me if it's the same week for recycling, or is that every other?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recycling is every other week. Since you've had two misses, I'll note that so the crew checks it. Can I have a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:43:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:43:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-one. All set, Mr. Mejia."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:43:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks."
    }
  ],
